SQL> --2]WRITE A QUERY TO DISPLAY 2ND RECORD FROM THE EMPLOYEE TABLE ?
SQL> 
SQL> SELECT *
  2  FROM (SELECT ROWNUM AS SLNO, EMP.* FROM EMP)
  3  WHERE SLNO = 2;

      SLNO      EMPNO ENAME      JOB              MGR HIREDATE         SAL       COMM     DEPTNO                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
